<title>USA: Michael Foods elects Knudtson board head.</title>
<headline>Michael Foods elects Knudtson board head.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Michael Foods Inc said Thursday its directors elected Arvid Knudtson, a director since 1987, as chairman of the board.</p>
<p>It said the chairman of the board position had been vacant since the February 28, 1997 merger of Michael Foods Inc, North Star Universal Inc and NSU Merger Co.</p>
<p>That transaction resulted in the formation of new Michael Foods Inc, with a new board largely comprised of members of predecessor Michael Foods Inc's board of directors.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
